Hmmm, that looks more like an indexing error. Make sure you extract the information and draw a simple plot in R before exporting it:
Something like
  image(inla.mesh.project(mesh, field=result$summary.linear.predictor[inla.stack.index(stack, "predictions"),"mean"]))
If the region corresponding to your domain of interest doesn't look like your current plot, then you have an indexing error.

There is no current support for exporting meshes.

Finn

